<title>USA: Kerr-McGee Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Kerr-McGee Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.27     loss	 $2.76</p>
<p> Net profit		62,300     loss     143,100</p>
<p> Revs		     487,600		  444,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  48,901		   51,858</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>					 9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $3.22     loss	 $1.17</p>
<p> Net profit	     160,900     loss	60,700</p>
<p> Revs		   1,412,600		1,338,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,751		   51,783</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding unusual items, net income from continuing operations in the quarter was $58 million ($1.17 per share), up 105 percent from $28 million (54 cents per share) in the 1995 third quarter. Including unusual items and discontinued operations, Kerr-McGee had a 1995 third-quarter net loss of $143 million ($2.76 per share).</p>
</text>
